"""Question bank v2: characters and what happens in the series.

Sources actually read in this session:
  TVDB  = TheTVDB episode guide (plot overview for almost every episode)
  EDB   = edb.co.il episode summaries (seasons 1-3, partly)
  WP/WQ = he.wikipedia / he.wikiquote (cast, characters)
  FAN   = shnothashmonim.fandom.com (Meni page)
  MAARIV, INN, ICE = press articles (Chaya Halabi, the film "HaHilula")
No question is about episode titles, order or air dates. Distractors are always things that are false in
the context the question sets up.
"""
